### Migration Guide

To continue using persistence, install `qortex-db` and use the new subpath-exported adapters. This ensures you only bundle the persistence logic you actually need.

#### New Approach

```ts
import { createDB } from 'qortex-db';
import { createQueryPersister } from 'qortex-db/query';
import { setDefaultConfig } from 'qortex-query';

const db = createDB({ name: 'myapp', driver: 'indexedDB' });

setDefaultConfig({
  persister: createQueryPersister(db)
});
```

For more details, see the [createQueryPersister](/db/docs/createQueryPersister) documentation.
